# mxk LLaMA-7B-slice perf (M=128, perf counters on) + two small kernels for gap analysis, 16x16 LUT configs (no FP4 x FP4 mode: MicroMix FP6/FP8 groups only):
#   sim/simq run-waves CONFIG=MxE4M3LutBf16Dim16GemminiBoomConfig,MxE4M3LutBf16Dim16GemminiBoomBw2Config BINARY=<gemmini-rocc-tests>/mx/jobs/mxk_d16.jobs
# Build: gemmini-rocc-tests ./build_rocc.sh mxk. l7p = 128x1024x128 (q/k/v/o/gate/up K),
# l7d = 128x1376x128 (down_proj K/8). kblock8 = MXFP8 base, kblock6 = MXFP6 E3M2 base; fp8 = all plain, lut0 = 66% LUT
# K-blocks (MXQuant b5), lut3 = all LUT, fp4_0 = 66% MXFP4 (ablation). micromix 468/48 = FP4+FP6+FP8 / FP4+FP8 groups.
mxk_kblock8_l7p_d16_fp8
mxk_kblock8_l7p_d16_lut0
mxk_kblock8_l7p_d16_lut3
mxk_kblock8_l7p_d16_fp4_0
mxk_kblock6_l7p_d16_fp8
mxk_kblock6_l7p_d16_lut0
mxk_kblock6_l7p_d16_lut3
mxk_kblock6_l7p_d16_fp4_0
mxk_kblock8_l7d_d16_fp8
mxk_kblock8_l7d_d16_lut0
mxk_kblock6_l7d_d16_fp8
mxk_kblock6_l7d_d16_lut0
mxk_micromix_l7p6_d16
mxk_micromix_l7p8_d16
# small kernels (gap analysis)
mxk_kblock8_tiny_d16_fp8
mxk_micromix_tiny8_d16
